  "welcome.faq.a1": "Yes! The Free plan gives you 3 AI conversations per day, 3 beginner coaching scenarios, basic feedback, community support, and 2 downloads per day — completely free, no credit card required, no time limit.",
  "welcome.faq.a2": "We offer two paid plans: Basic ($5.99/month) with 10 AI conversations per day, intermediate scenarios, progress tracking, and CSV/TXT exports. Premium ($15.99/month) unlocks unlimited conversations, all live AI tools, advanced analytics, PDF/DOCX/CSV exports, and priority support. Both plans offer 20% savings with yearly billing.",
  "welcome.faq.a3": "Absolutely. You can upgrade, downgrade, or cancel your subscription at any time from your Account Settings. Changes take effect immediately, and you\\",
  "welcome.faq.a4": "RealAICoach includes GPS-managed enterprise AI tools across live categories. Free users get access to starter experiences, while Premium unlocks the active catalog configured in GlobalPlatformState.",
  "welcome.faq.a5": "Yes. We use secure authentication via Google and Microsoft SSO, all data is transmitted over encrypted HTTPS connections, and your conversations are stored securely. We never share your personal data with third parties or use it to train external models.",
  "welcome.faq.a6": "Free users get 2 downloads per day. Basic plan adds TXT and CSV exports with 30-day history. Premium plan includes unlimited downloads, full history, and all export formats including PDF and DOCX — plus print functionality.",
  "welcome.faq.a7": "From the Basic plan onwards, you get detailed progress tracking with visual charts and analytics. Premium users get AI-powered insights, performance scores, and skill breakdown dashboards to track their growth over time.",
